(30801, 'ha', 'ProductNameTooltip', 'Sunan da aka nuna a kan rasidin, inwoyis, kantinku da rahotanni. 3 zuwa 55 haruffa.', 0, '2026-07-07 00:40:37.000000', '2026-07-07 00:40:37.000000'),
(30802, 'ha', 'BarcodeSymbologyTooltip', 'Tsarin barcode da ya dace da lakabin kayanku. CODE128 shi ne tsoho mai aminci ga yawancin kayayyaki.', 0, '2026-07-07 00:40:37.000000', '2026-07-07 00:40:37.000000'),
(30803, 'ha', 'ProductCodeTooltip', 'Mai gano na musamman don wannan kayan. Bincika barcode da ke akwai ko latsa maɓallin barcode don samar da ɗaya. Tabbatar da cewa alamar da ke sama ta dace da lambar.', 0, '2026-07-07 00:40:37.000000', '2026-07-07 00:40:37.000000'),
(30804, 'ha', 'SubcategoriesMultiTooltip', 'Na zaɓi. Zaɓi ɗaya ko fiye na rukuni masu zuwa cikin rukuni da aka zaɓa. Na farko ana adana shi a matsayin ƙaramin rukuni na farko don tsofaffin API da masu tacewa.', 0, '2026-07-07 00:40:37.000000', '2026-07-07 00:40:37.000000'),
(30805, 'ha', 'BrandTooltip', 'Na zaɓi. Mai ƙera ko tambari na wannan kayan. Yana taimakawa wajen tace, rahoto da yawo a kanti.', 0, '2026-07-07 00:40:37.000000', '2026-07-07 00:40:37.000000'),
(30806, 'ha', 'DescriptionTooltip', 'Na zaɓi. Bayyani gajere da ake nunawa a kan rasidin, inwoyis da kantinku na kan layi. Ku gudanar da shi a takaice kuma da abokantaka ga abokin ciniki.', 0, '2026-07-07 00:40:37.000000', '2026-07-07 00:40:37.000000'),
